sequenceDiagram
    participant CLI as bomify build or mirror
    participant Plugin as bomify-plugin binary
    participant Disk as Data directory

    CLI->>CLI: detect a kind from the component's purl type
    CLI->>CLI: find the matching binary on PATH
    rect rgb(236, 253, 245)
        CLI->>Plugin: pull or push, over a subprocess call
        Plugin->>Disk: read or write the component's artifact
        Plugin->>Disk: write its own log output, never to stdout
        Plugin-->>CLI: a single JSON result on stdout
    end
    CLI->>Disk: record the component's manifest
